h, then roll up your sleeves and install, upgrade, and customize every last detail with your own two hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your survival demands grow, so does your safe house. Expand it floor by floor. Living quarters, storage rooms, power generation, and even farming areas... everything meticulously planned and in its place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resource you invest before the apocalypse becomes the lifeline that keeps you alive after.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164790/extras/c68ea9c0a6c57d5821995eb73eb9de84.poster.avif?t=1788236561\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164790/extras/c68ea9c0a6c57d5821995eb73eb9de84.webm?t=1788236561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164790/extras/c68ea9c0a6c57d5821995eb73eb9de84.mp4?t=1788236561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your stronghold and become self-sufficient.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own crops and cook proper meals because surviving the apocalypse doesn't mean giving up the good life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power your base with diesel, manual generators, or solar. Every watt is a resource you can't waste.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage hunger, stamina, and morale. Survival isn't just about staying alive; it's about staying sane.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164790/extras/1a5742fb966e56f8a3d89c304246034b.poster.avif?t=1788236561\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=