r memories, uncover the disaster's truth.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164790/extras/a4eeb84e0aeff99c5a3893715b2afeeb.poster.avif?t=1788236561\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164790/extras/a4eeb84e0aeff99c5a3893715b2afeeb.webm?t=1788236561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164790/extras/a4eeb84e0aeff99c5a3893715b2afeeb.mp4?t=1788236561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The apocalypse is here, and you saw it coming. Survival Log is a zombie-apocalypse hoarding survival sim. Hoard supplies, reinforce your home, and optimize every run before zombies flood the city. Every failure becomes experience. You must adapt and survive this time.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164790/5f5a1a66f988690c1507b383be89b2869c17e17f/header.jpg?t=1788236561", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164790/fd42f9bb4e955c05ed5d086216d0c9c724893d40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788236561", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164790/fd42f9bb4e955c05ed5d086216d0c9c724893d40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788236561", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8500 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 / Radeon RX 6500 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available 